            (f"How can I reduce {svc_name.lower()} costs in {city}?",
             f"Ask if a general practice vet can handle the procedure instead of a specialist — this typically saves 40-60%. Request an itemised estimate before any procedure. Ask about payment plans for bills over $500. Low-cost clinics and humane societies in {city} can provide significant savings for routine procedures."),
            (f"Does pet insurance cover {svc_name.lower()}?",
             f"Most pet insurance policies cover {svc_name.lower()} if the condition was not pre-existing when the policy was taken out. Review your policy's coverage and deductible before the procedure. Pet insurance typically pays back 2-4x its cost for dogs over 8 years of age."),
