            ("Mediation in Fulton County",
             f"Fulton County has an active Alternative Dispute Resolution programme and judges regularly refer contested cases to mediation. Atlanta mediation costs $3,000–$6,000 total — versus $11,500 for contested litigation. Atlanta's strong mediation bar includes practitioners with specific experience in corporate executive compensation division — particularly relevant for the city's large corporate community."),
